{"id":"e92b5c50303f0467","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_CurryAccept.md","title":"CurryAccept","display":"CurryAccept","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"CurryAccept","parameters":["g","t","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"CurryAccept"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>g</span><span>t</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：Curry 简单类型算法。有序参数：<code>g</code>、<code>t</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ CurryAccept g t a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ CurryInput g t a)\n  (exists z\n    (exists m\n      (exists E\n        (exists b\n          (exists e\n            (exists s\n              (exists EE\n                (and\n                  (@ Num0 z)\n                  (and\n                    (@ CGenerate g t z m E b)\n                    (and (@ Pair b a e) (and (@ Single e s) (and (@ Union2 E s EE) (@ CSolve EE))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"828ce1f1e146d1bc\" href=\"?note=828ce1f1e146d1bc\" title=\"ZFC_CGenerate\">CGenerate</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4c29bc243249e127\" href=\"?note=4c29bc243249e127\" title=\"ZFC_CSolve\">CSolve</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d286b9758fa69367\" href=\"?note=d286b9758fa69367\" title=\"ZFC_CurryInput\">CurryInput</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e8cec2782b4668b5\" href=\"?note=e8cec2782b4668b5\" title=\"ZFC_Num0\">Num0</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"bdbfd129fa484068\" href=\"?note=bdbfd129fa484068\" title=\"ZFC_Single\">Single</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"bb2bfe91c0c7d416\" href=\"?note=bb2bfe91c0c7d416\" title=\"ZFC_Union2\">Union2</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ CurryAccept g t a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_CGenerate","status":"resolved","id":"828ce1f1e146d1bc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_CGenerate|CGenerate]]；[[ZFC_CSolve|CSolve]]；[[ZFC_CurryInput|CurryInput]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Single|Single]]；[[ZFC_Union2|Union2]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_CSolve","status":"resolved","id":"4c29bc243249e127","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_CGenerate|CGenerate]]；[[ZFC_CSolve|CSolve]]；[[ZFC_CurryInput|CurryInput]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_Single|Single]]；[[ZFC_Union2|Union2]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_CurryInput","status":"resolved","id":"d286b9758fa69367","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_CGenerate|CGenerate]]；[[ZFC_CSolve|CSolve]]；[[ZFC_CurryInput|CurryInput]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]；[[ZFC_Pair|Pair]]；[[ZFC_